Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Apply supplied fairness and priority principles to feasible bundles, using exact inventory and transport constraints. Explain tradeoffs and preserve unmet needs without inventing deservingness criteria or optimizing only the easiest deliveries.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
